  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Local Community capacity for their participation indecision making</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PSEC Project will strengthen groups and associations of women and young people in their internal resource mobilization activities (EPC), while providing support in their production and pastoral activity, follow -up and support for groups of young people and women in the management of their affairs. Also the project envisages the capacity building of grassroots community organizations to influence at the grassroots level the decisions that affect their lives. To achieve this, national and regional advocacy actions will be carried out.</narrative>
  </description>
